<p>课程性质</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 11.088%; height: 99px;" width="85">
<p>教学内容</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 7.07095%; height: 99px;" width="28">
<p>教师</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 41.9863%; height: 99px;" width="242">
<p>教学目标</p>
</td>
