<p>深龋治疗与盖髓术</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 7.07095%; height: 527px;" width="28">
<p>王丽琴</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 41.9863%; height: 527px;" width="242">
<p><strong>知识目标：</strong></p>
<p>1.能够理解记忆深龋治疗的原则及盖髓术的适应征。</p>
<p>2.能够归纳总结间接盖髓术和直接盖髓术的操作步骤。</p>
<p>3.能够理解盖髓术的原理。</p>
<p><strong>能力目标：</strong></p>
<p>1.能够根据深龋的治疗原则，结合患者的病史、临床表现和辅助检查，选择合适的深龋的治疗方法。</p>
<p>2.针对不同的深龋的治疗方法，能够熟练掌握其原理及操作步骤。</p>
<p><strong>素养目标：</strong></p>
<p>1.建立共情与爱伤：以患者为中心，尊重患者、保护患者隐私、告知充分、操作轻柔稳定。</p>
<p>2.建立全局观念：在重点治疗患牙的同时，关注患者的精神状态和全身状况，并及时做好术后观察及随访。</p>
<p>3.兼顾预防与治疗：重视预防观念，在日常工作和医患交流中传播龋病预防理念。</p>
</td>
</tr>
