<p>牙髓病及根尖周病的治疗计划</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 7.07095%; height: 489px;" width="28">
<p>杨阳</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 41.9863%; height: 489px;" width="242">
<p><strong>知识目标：</strong></p>
<p>1.例举局部麻醉的常用方法及疼痛控制方法。</p>
<p>2.阐述牙髓病和根尖周病的治疗原则和应急处理措施。</p>
<p>3.归纳牙髓病和根尖周病的治疗原则。</p>
<p><strong>能力目标：</strong></p>
<p>1.知识能力：学生能够根据诊断结果选择合适的麻醉和疼痛管理方案。</p>
<p>2.临床思维能力：学生在正确诊断， 全面评估患者的基础上，制定科学、合理、可操作的治疗计划，能正确应急处理疼痛。</p>
<p><strong>素养目标：</strong></p>
<p>1.以患者为中心，以缓解患者疼痛和改善患者生活质量为目标，注重治疗计划的可行性与患者接受度。</p>
<p>2.强化全局意识，在治疗中综合考虑患者口腔健康、全身状况及心理需求，确保诊疗方案的整体性。</p>
</td>
</tr>
