<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 11.088%; height: 550px;" width="85">
<p>根管治疗术</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 7.07095%; height: 550px;" width="28">
<p>韦晓玲</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 41.9863%; height: 550px;" width="242">
<p><strong>知识目标：</strong></p>
<p>1.列出根管治疗术的概念。</p>
<p>2.解释根管治疗术的原理和疗效评价标准。</p>
<p>3.归纳根管治疗术的病例选择和操作原则。</p>
<p><strong>能力目标：</strong></p>
<p>1.科学思维能力：结合根管系统内微生物感染的特点，思考根管治疗术彻底控制根管内感染的重要性。</p>
<p>2.临床思维能力：训练学生自主发现、思考并解决临床相关问题的能力。</p>
<p>3.观察分析能力：引导学生通过分析根管治疗术后X线片表现，思考分析根尖周病的疗效评价标准，提高观察分析能力。</p>
<p><strong>素养目标：</strong></p>
<p>1.通过精准快速诊断，极大限度缓解患者疼痛，提高患者生活质量，体现医者仁心。</p>
<p>2.树立以患者为中心的理念，树立“爱伤”意识，贯彻预防为主、防治结合的理念，尽可能为患者进行牙髓保存及天然牙齿保存。</p>
</td>
</tr>
