<p>再生性牙髓治疗，根尖诱导成形术，根尖屏障术</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 7.07095%; height: 511px;" width="28">
<p>韦晓玲</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 41.9863%; height: 511px;" width="242">
<p><strong>识目标：</strong></p>
<p>1.理解根尖诱导成形术的修复机制并列出其愈合类型。</p>
<p>2.讲述根尖屏障术的原理和适应证。</p>
<p>3.概述根尖诱导成形术和根尖屏障术的操作步骤及要点，并分析归纳两者的异同点。</p>
<p>4.描述根尖屏障术的预后。</p>
<p>5.概述牙髓再生性治疗的概念及原理，列举牙髓再生成功标准。</p>
<p><strong>能力目标：</strong></p>
<p>1.通过案例分析，知道根尖诱导成形和根尖屏障的适应证，能选择合适的治疗方法。</p>
<p>2.能够归纳总结根尖诱导成形术和根尖屏障术的操作步骤，应用于临床。</p>
<p><strong>素养目标：</strong>爱伤观念——根尖诱导成形和根尖屏障对根管粗大的年轻恒牙保留意义重大，牙齿也是器官，加强学生对保存天然牙的意识。</p>
</td>
</tr>
