<p>感染牙髓的治疗方法（TBL教学）</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 7.07095%; height: 335px;" width="28">
<p>杨德琴</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 41.9863%; height: 335px;" width="242">
<p><strong>知识目标</strong></p>
<p>1.通过病例分析回顾牙体硬组织疾病、牙髓病、根尖周病的核心知识点。</p>
<p>2.通过TBL教学应用牙体牙髓病的知识分析和解决临床问题。</p>
<p>3.加深知识难点的理解，前后贯通、举一反三。</p>
<p><strong>能力目标：</strong>以形成性评价为主、终结性考核为辅，结合各人测试、小组测试、集体讨论、小组总结四个环节客观了解对知识点的认识和应用能力，并在回顾和总结中提升。</p>
<p><strong>素养目标：</strong>通过TBL教学培养思辨能力、团队协作能力、主动学习能力。</p>
</td>
</tr>
